abstract: "ARCLUX parses 27 programming languages into a live dependency and call graph, traces the impact of every change, runs 20 architecture detectors and framework convention rules, exposes a security pipeline, and is scriptable through its own registry-driven DSL. Ships as CLI, interactive web dashboard, always-on daemon, and VS Code extension."
